OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham looks to show he
OL,4,Awill go further than Starmer with West
OL,5,ABank sanctions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is little doubt that the UK's
OL,8,Fdecision to ban imports from Israeli
OL,9,Fsettlements in the occupied West Bank
OL,10,Fis another significant shift in
OL,11,FBritain's posture in the Middle East.
OL,13,FThe announcement from the Foreign
OL,14,FSecretary Ed Miliband, with the Prime
OL,15,FMinister Andy Burnham alongside him in
OL,16,Fthe House of Commons, comes almost
OL,17,Fexactly a year after the UK formally
OL,18,Frecognised a Palestinian state. And it
OL,19,Fcomes garnished with blunt language
OL,20,Fabout Israel's conduct.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
